:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/recruiting/story/_/id/48543549/college-football-recruiting-2027-prospects-five-star-scouts-take","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-27T15:51:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Houston, rivalry color rushes lead top uniforms of CFB Week 13","description":"Just because it's rivalry week doesn't mean teams still can't put their best foot forward with uniform swag.","published":"2026-11-27T15:00:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50598211/college-football-uniforms-week-13-houston","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What the world looked like the last time Texas A&M beat Texas","description":"It has been 15 years since Texas A&M came out on top on the gridiron against its rivals to the southwest.","published":"2026-11-27T17:36:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/47109982/texas-aggies-lone-star-showdown-last-win-2010","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 NFL draft Big Board rankings: Mel Kiper's top 25 prospects, best by position","description":"Three quarterbacks who could go early? Big changes in the rankings? Mel Kiper Jr. stacks the best players on the 2027 draft board as of late November.","published":"2026-11-27T14:49:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft2027/story/_/id/50182998/2027-nfl-draft-rankings-kiper-big-board-top-prospects","type":"Story","byline":"Mel Kiper Jr.","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-27T12:39:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5146422/xavier-gilliam","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier_Gilliam"},"pick":{"pick":11,"round":1,"team":"LV","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Xavier Gilliam","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier_Gilliam","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-26T23:15:23Z","intro":"Xavier Harold Gilliam is an American football defensive tackle for the Tennessee Volunteers. He previously played for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Gilliam attended Wilde Lake High School in Columbia, Maryland and Quince Orchard High School in Gaithersburg, Maryland. He committed to play college football for the Penn State Nittany Lions over offers from Boston College, Maryland, Ole Miss, Texas A&M, West Virginia, and Virginia Tech."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman at Penn State in 2024, Gilliam was redshirted. During the 2025 season, he appeared in 13 games with two starts, totaling 15 tackles with two for loss, a forced fumble, and a blocked field goal. After the conclusion of the season, Gilliam entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nGilliam transferred to play for the Tennessee Volunteers. In the 2026 season opener, he posted six tackles with five for loss, and three sacks in a win over Furman."}]}}